  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fNz5/70",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 열량계와 이산화탄소 센서, 수온 센서<br>효모, 설탕, 물, 커피포트를 활용하여 실험을 했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/edec95d13034ed434f0edd1bf3ea488959b173c3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/edec95d13034ed434f0edd1bf3ea488959b173c3\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">효모 뿌린 직후에는 정말 물위에 떠서,<br>무슨 가루만 가득한 줄 알았습니다ㅋㅋㅋ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9a535a361414a3d86a2fe232f99537469a0040a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9a535a361414a3d86a2fe232f99537469a0040a\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">온도가 낮은 물에는 효모가 잘 녹지 않지만,<br>온도가 높은 물에 효모를 넣으면 바로 반응해버리기 때문에... 열심히 섞는다 아자자!!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0d4c6cffc18f308e8c83bd00dccf41874980bea5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0d4c6cffc18f308e8c83bd00dccf41874980bea5\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">설탕도 5g 넣고~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6796924607ed637cf048a0fbaf325772f8287c98\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6796924607ed637cf048a0fbaf325772f8287c98\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">바깥쪽에 뜨거운 물을 붓고 나서 뚜껑을 닫습니다.<br>꼭 최대한 테이프로 구멍을 막아서<br>이산화탄소 유출을 막아봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30253939c92fea217f7c719762adde9a942ef415\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30253939c92fea217f7c719762adde9a942ef415\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그 다음에는 똑같이 준비하고,<br>설탕을 10g 넣습니다.(아까는 5g)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3fceb6f67aeee6e30d733dc873ad85cb59bf0f9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3fceb6f67aeee6e30d733dc873ad85cb59bf0f9\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">바깥쪽에 뜨거운 물을 넣고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/98a5b3a142b3e0b217527c0be35854714dfdb83a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/98a5b3a142b3e0b217527c0be35854714dfdb83a\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">기다립니다!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b41b97445b543e5af3eb5f0ea7c88924de4dacf0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b41b97445b543e5af3eb5f0ea7c88924de4dacf0\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">실험 결과는 다음과 같습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72f1b035f1bcbf805ea60d1f6c5202ab3cdbcaa4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72f1b035f1bcbf805ea60d1f6c5202ab3cdbcaa4\" data-origin-width=\"589\" data-origin-height=\"455\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">주요 변인은 설탕의 양과<br>물의 온도였습니다!<br><br>효모는 확실히 30도 이상에서부터<br>잘 반응하기 시작하며,<br>설탕의 양이 많을 수록<br>더 활발하게 반응한다는 것을 <br>실험을 통해 알 수 있었습니다.<br>--------------------------------------------<br>봄봄봄 축제 출강을 위해서<br>버니어 센서로도 이것저것 시도해봤습니다.<br><br>후~멀리서 불어보기</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvyxbdba7yirwi6eqfwsrwb7x@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1440\" data-video-height=\"1440\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvyxbdba7yirwi6eqfwsrwb7x/thumbs/4.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33332470021&amp;signature=dD%2BMah9gEp9m7fLrhZvWczKGhLM%3D&amp;ts=1775561221\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1440\" data-video-origin-height=\"1440\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvyxbdba7yirwi6eqfwsrwb7x?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2eXhiZGJhN3lpcndpNmVxZndzcndiN3giLCJ0aWQiOiI1ODBjNzZlZC00YmQ4LTRlYWYtYmU2NC04YTdjZjJhZDVhZDMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODc5OTR9.LeDy4RhOO38DnXeVbaiX0lB0m9h04GRfhOnPwYz2gcew6ClA0d6Zc5Sx1eSVrTffSTd1f_-aQPi2z9Mzn_2cQQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">탄산 음료 탁! 따보기</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvm65f6eshju1fo64p20hts4i@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1440\" data-video-height=\"1440\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvm65f6eshju1fo64p20hts4i/thumbs/5.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33332470019&amp;signature=gJPPHmN5wYdJzX2V8JBF5m5HrjM%3D&amp;ts=1775561219\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1440\" data-video-origin-height=\"1440\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvm65f6eshju1fo64p20hts4i?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2bTY1ZjZlc2hqdTFmbzY0cDIwaHRzNGkiLCJ0aWQiOiI3NGYxNTdlYi0zNzhjLTQ2MmItYmM3NC0yOWI4MmEwYmQ2YjgiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODc5OTR9.oS-mlhFkDe1t_rDcUfcIk5vunNxsivyb7VoowQClvgKd4QJq1VtO7Euzq44lKILv69uLpKzHheefkOVsufDeiQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvmfximdx8l05xcw3vsixelk3@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1440\" data-video-height=\"1440\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvmfximdx8l05xcw3vsixelk3/thumbs/4.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33332470021&amp;signature=%2Fjsb1tZ9K2zs4nIOMHbjl9BPmJ0%3D&amp;ts=1775561221\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1440\" data-video-origin-height=\"1440\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvmfximdx8l05xcw3vsixelk3?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2bWZ4aW1keDhsMDV4Y3czdnNpeGVsazMiLCJ0aWQiOiJhZjE4YTI0Ny0yNjE2LTQ4ZWMtODE0YS02NjlhMzI3ODk0MTciLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODc5OTR9.o5xRX544c7YfGpui2CIFJQK1sfxXsW-z_i2PBEgAXN9FUEzwuukjF2j_75aPY54sSiyjI8G9wvtdpzay2bzAuA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아까와 비슷한 실험 해보기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/37ed11621b239f3532ecc5b71b867b3bddb5f7e2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/37ed11621b239f3532ecc5b71b867b3bddb5f7e2\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2efa98628735be1fae54dded1d7b223147371054\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2efa98628735be1fae54dded1d7b223147371054\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvmtv03ie2lrlqqy4iqw4o93a@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1440\" data-video-height=\"1440\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvmtv03ie2lrlqqy4iqw4o93a/thumbs/5.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33332470020&amp;signature=Fo2JxgWv44dcWZ8ghlTUwH5d9Ig%3D&amp;ts=1775561220\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1440\" data-video-origin-height=\"1440\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvmtv03ie2lrlqqy4iqw4o93a?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2bXR2MDNpZTJscmxxcXk0aXF3NG85M2EiLCJ0aWQiOiI3YTEyYWEzYS0zZDU2LTRlNzItODc4OS0xYzViMDkzOTVkNmYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODc5OTR9.YurtJVTbESoUuziZATI3Zs_25PUW4y2uiePqHGWuTcKwjoNtdcucGBe9iZl7Trr6gYAC4HUljNxRaNYM290kSA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">첫번째 빨간색 화살표는 멀리서 후~ 불었을 때<br>두번째 빨간색 화살표는 캔 딴 직후 주변 이산화탄소량<br>첫번째 파란색 화살표는 설탕 조금 넣었을 때<br>두번째 파란색 화살표는 설탕 많이 넣었을 때</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/345da4573c6091529551cc2d3da57671603d370e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/345da4573c6091529551cc2d3da57671603d370e\" data-origin-width=\"1498\" data-origin-height=\"946\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">학생들이랑 효모의 이산화탄소 방출량에 영향을 미치는 요인들을 조금씩 바꿔보며 실험하기 좋을 것 같습니다!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bacVh6/dJMb83ktH0s/20eeUK3YjKUWFHejbb3yk1/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bacVh6/dJMb83ktH0s/20eeUK3YjKUWFHejbb3yk1/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2F